  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎈 שִׂיחָה בְּצִיּוּרִים –&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַסִּימָנִים שֶׁמְּלַמְּדִים לִבְחֹר</span></span></h2><h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">🧒 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַיֶּלֶד</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (מִסְתַּכֵּל סָבִיב):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲנִי שׁוֹמֵעַ כָּל הַזְּמַן “כָּשֵׁר” ו“לֹא כָּשֵׁר”.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲבָל אֵיךְ בִּכְלָל יוֹדְעִים?</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🐄 </span>הַבְּהֵמוֹת וְהַחַיּוֹת<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (מְדַבְּרוֹת יַחַד):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">לֹא כָּל בְּהֵמָה וְלֹא כָּל חַיָּה מֻתֶּרֶת לַאֲכִילָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">יֵשׁ לָנוּ כְּלָלִים בְּרוּרִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\">🦶 פַּרְסָה + 🔁 גֵּרָה (יַחַד):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">כַּף הָרֶגֶל שֶׁל הַחַיָּה צְרִיכָה לִהְיוֹת סְדוּקָה לִשְׁנַיִם.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">הָאֹכֶל שֶׁל הַחַיָּה צָרִיךְ לַעֲלוֹת מֵהַקֵּבָה לִלְעִיסָה נוֹסֶפֶת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🐟 </span>עוֹלַם הַמַּיִם<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (מְרַשְׁרֵשׁ):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מְעַנְיֵן. אֶצְלֵנוּ זֶה לְגַמְרֵי אַחֶרֶת!<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\">➰ סְנַפִּיר + 🛡️ קַשְׁקֶשֶׁת (יַחַד):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">לַדָּג כָּשֵׁר יֵשׁ סְנַפִּיר שֶׁבְּאֶמְצָעוּתוֹ הוּא נָע בַּמַּיִם,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">וְגַם קַשְׂקַשִּׂים חֲלָקִים וְקָשִׁים הַמְּשַׁמְּשִׁים לַהֲגָנָה עַל גּוּפוֹ.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">🐦 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָעוֹפוֹת</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (עוֹמְדִים בַּצַּד):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">וְאֶצְלֵנוּ אֵין סִימָנִים כָּאֵלֶּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">📜 <span style=\"color: #660000;\">מָסֹרֶת (נִפְתַּחַת):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֵצֶל עוֹפוֹת הוֹלְכִים לְפִי מָסֹרֶת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מִי שֶׁיֵּשׁ עָלָיו מָסֹרֶת אֲכִילָה – מֻתָּר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מִי שֶׁאֵין – לֹא אוֹכְלִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🦗 </span>הַחֲגָבִים<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (מְקַפְּצִים):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">גַּם אֶצְלֵנוּ זֶה כָּכָה!<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">רַק סוּגִים מְסֻיָּמִים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">וְרַק עִם מָסֹרֶת בְּרוּרָה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🧒 </span>הַיֶּלֶד<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (עוֹצֵר רֶגַע):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אָז רֶגַע…<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֵיךְ אֲנִי אֵדַע אֵיזֶה בָּשָׂר לִקְנוֹת לְשַׁבָּת?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲנִי לֹא יוֹדֵעַ לִבְדֹּק סִימָנִים וּמָסוֹרוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🏷️ </span>חוֹתֶמֶת הַכַּשְׁרוּת<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (מוֹפִיעָה):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">בִּשְׁבִיל זֶה אֲנִי כָּאן.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אִם יֵשׁ עַל הַבָּשָׂר תָּוִית בְּרוּרָה –<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מִישֶׁהוּ בָּדַק בִּשְׁבִילְךָ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">בָּדְקוּ אֶת הַחַיָּה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">בָּדְקוּ אֶת הַשְּׁחִיטָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">בָּדְקוּ אֶת הַכְּלָלִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">וְאַתָּה יָכוֹל לִקְנוֹת בְּשֶׁקֶט.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🥚 </span>הַבֵּיצָה<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (מִתְגַּלְגֶּלֶת בַּעֲדִינוּת):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">גַּם אֲנִי אֹכֶל.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲבָל לֹא כָּל בֵּיצָה מֻתֶּרֶת. רַק שֶׁל עוֹף טָהוֹר!</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🐶 </span>הַכֶּלֶב הֶחָמוּד<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (מְנַפְנֵף בַּזָּנָב):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">רֶגַע…<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אִם אָסוּר לֶאֱכֹל אוֹתִי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אָז גַּם אָסוּר לְגַדֵּל אוֹתִי?</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🐰 </span>הָאַרְנֶבֶת<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (קוֹפֶצֶת):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">וּמָה אִתִּי?</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>✨<span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַתּוֹרָה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (מַסְבִּירָה):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">יֵשׁ הֶבְדֵּל בֵּין לֶאֱכֹל&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">לְבֵין לְגַדֵּל.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🐶 </span>הַכֶּלֶב<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> (</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נִרְגַּע</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">)</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">:<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מֻתָּר לְגַדֵּל אוֹתִי,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">לִדְאֹג לִי,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">וּלְשַׂחֵק אִתִּי.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🐰 </span>הָאַרְנֶבֶת<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">נִרְגַּעַת):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">וְגַם אוֹתִי.&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">פָּשׁוּט לֹא אוֹכְלִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">🧒 </span>הַיֶּלֶד<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (מְסַכֵּם):<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">אָז הַתּוֹרָה לֹא אוֹמֶרֶת&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">שֶׁמַּשֶּׁהוּ הוּא רַע.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">הִיא רַק מְלַמֶּדֶת&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מָה נִכְנַס לַצַּלַּחַת -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">וּמָה לֹא.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">.</span></span></p></h2><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תפזורת בעלי חיים</span><br /><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מצאו את 🔍 בעלי החיים האסורים באכילה: חֹלֶד, עַכְבָּר, צָּב, אֲנָקָה, כֹּחַ, לְּטָאָה, חֹמֶט, תִּנְשָׁמֶת, קָּאָת, רָחָם, שָּׁחַף<br />בכיוונים ⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></div><a href=\"/assets/images/content/d61ff2f068d7150c26.png\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/d61ff2f068d7150c26.png\" /></a><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָאֵשׁ יָרְדָה מֵהַשָּׁמַיִם וְאָכְלָה אֶת הַקָּרְבָּנוֹת עַל הַמִּזְבֵּחַ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִצְווֹת כַּשְׁרוּת הַחַי מוֹפִיעוֹת בְּפָרָשַׁת שְׁמִינִי?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נָדָב וַאֲבִיהוּא נֶעֶנְשׁוּ כִּי נִכְנְסוּ לַמִּשְׁכָּן בְּרִיצָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַחֲרֵי מוֹת נָדָב וַאֲבִיהוּא - אַהֲרֹן שָׁתַק?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְכָל הַדָּגִים יֵשׁ סְנַפִּיר וְקַשְׂקֶשֶׂת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָסוּר לַכֹּהֲנִים לַעֲבֹד בַּמִּשְׁכָּן כְּשֶׁהֵם שְׁתוּיֵי יַיִן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִתָּר לֶאֱכֹל בְּהֵמָה שֶׁיֵּשׁ לָהּ פַּרְסָה סְדוּקָה בִּלְבַד?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם יֵשׁ סוּגֵי חֲגָבִים שֶׁמֻּתָּרִים בַּאֲכִילָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה אוֹסֶרֶת לָגַעַת בְּכָל חַיָּה שֶׁאֵינָהּ כְּשֵׁרָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּפָרָשַׁת שְׁמִינִי נֶאֱמַר שֶׁצָּרִיךְ לְהַבְדִּיל בֵּין הַטָּמֵא וּבֵין הַטָּהֹר?</span></li></ol></div>"
}
